            "notes": "## Items\n\nThe item that you always want to get is [Zero-G Suit](item_404d695a-1c12-47ac-9bc4-00b6e6e985e6) because it makes everything easier. Then you just add as much damage as you can with [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f), or if you don\u2019t have enough money, [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054). This already puts you at 10% CDR.\n\nAlso buy [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) if you have enough money after getting [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f).",
