            "notes": "## Power\n\n[Circuit Breaker](item_ee0bd3b8-4c0d-40e6-a2a2-be20deef0e19) gives you a bit of sustain and works well with [Electro Cluster](item_2ce040d2-6b47-4be6-83b3-f8266c2c2b48).\n\nIf they have easy-to-punch targets, you can run [Primal Punch](item_3b024d32-8fa1-4713-80ee-e042867f5228). Landing on targets with a punch is a huge amount of burst, and you can do things like jump \u2192 melee \u2192 M1/punch \u2192 jump again (since the cooldown is so low), kill the target, and jump out again.\n\n## Item\n\nWe add more CDR with [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448). You can sell the green items potentially if you don\u2019t have enough.\n\nThe alternative is [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98). We mostly buy this for the CDR, but the healing is useful as well.\n\n## Counterpick Items\n\nWe will also go over the counterpick options here (THEY WILL NOT BE MENTIONED LATER, BUY THEM WHENEVER YOU FEEL YOU NEED THEM OR YOU HAVE SPARE MONEY):\n\n- [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) is great if they have armor or shields because you zap multiple targets\u2014sometimes it's not that hard to trigger\n- [Smart-Armor](item_2e0f4a99-c818-49c1-ace2-ba8d6f282da8) if you struggle to live vs. shotguns\n- [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) just makes you overall more tanky; works well with [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016)\n- [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) vs. heroes that like to headshot, like Cass, Soldier, Zen, D.Va\n- [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) vs. debuffs like Ashe dynamite, Ana sleep/nade, JQ bleeds\n- [Premium Peanut Butter](item_c4cd51d3-e631-4c4c-9a9f-d586a6d0d5de) is very similar to [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f)but works well with the low CDR",
